        "en": "Compassionate veterinary team and doctors"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners uniformly commend Dr. Eduardo Garcia and the clinic staff for their thoroughness, patience, and warm bedside manner. Clients appreciate that the medical team listens carefully to concerns, provides attentive follow-up communication, and explains treatment options clearly in a family-like atmosphere."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 24,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle and attentive pet handling"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers frequently emphasize how gently both dogs and cats are handled during routine exams, surgeries, and emergency visits. Clients note that even nervous pets remain comfortable and calm during appointments, praising the staff for treating every animal as if they were their own beloved family member."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "place",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 13,
      "title": {
        "en": "Equipped neighborhood veterinary clinic"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients appreciate the convenient Westchester location and organized facility, specifically highlighting the clinic's on-site laboratory for rapid diagnostic testing. Pet owners value having in-house testing capabilities that yield immediate bloodwork results during critical consultations and travel health preparation."
      }
    }
  ],
